              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.2697502760384973,
              "coords": {
                "equipment_point_rows": 1
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "both_scc_ladders_stop_on_the_right_rung",
          "description": "§2.3 and §6.0. The month and day lookups walk the zero-2/4/6 ladder INDEPENDENTLY and against different tables, and both stop at 2260007000 for this SCC. The exact SCC has no row in either table and 2260000000 has one in nrmonthallocation, so a ladder that fell straight through to the six-zero rung would still find a month row -- carrying 0.117764 instead of 0.0833333, a 41% error with no missing-row to notice.",
          "time_span": {
