        {
          "id": "the_loop_bound_and_the_skip_are_two_separate_gates",
          "description": "prccty.f writes the cohort loop as `for idx in range(nyrlif)` with `if modfrc <= 0: continue` inside it, and NEITHER half implies the other. This test is the pair of counterexamples that proves it, and both of them are in this fixture's own data.\n\nTHE BOUND WITHOUT THE SKIP. Point 1's slot 4 holds 5.93e-08, a POSITIVE number -- agedist.f keeps shifting cohorts past nyrlif and stops scrapping them, so the vector does not go to zero there. Its nyrlif is 3, so the reference never reads slot 4. Drop the bound and this SCC gains 48 model years, every one of them emitting a real row.\n\nTHE SKIP WITHOUT THE BOUND. Point 5's slot 3 is INSIDE its nyrlif of 3 and holds exactly 0.0, because age 3's year-over-year scrap fraction is 1. Drop the skip and this SCC gains a model year. §7.3 measured the whole fixture both ways: `modfrc < 0` and no skip at all each over-emit by 44 rows.\n\nAnd the cell that separates the two precisions is asserted from both sides: point 1's slot 3 holds 5.888558263222876e-08 -- binary32's 5.8885583e-08, exactly -- and is POPULATED. In binary64 that cell is 0.0 and the skip removes it, taking model year 2018 and four MOVESOutput rows with it.",
          "time_span": {
            "start": 0.0,
            "end": 0.0
          },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "Nonroad.slot_grownModelYearFraction",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 5.888558263222876e-08,
              "coords": {
                "equipment_point_rows": 1,
                "age_slot_rows": 3
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Nonroad.slot_isPopulated",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 1.0,
              "coords": {
                "equipment_point_rows": 1,
                "age_slot_rows": 3
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Nonroad.slot_grownModelYearFraction",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 5.9287433629151565e-08,
              "coords": {
                "equipment_point_rows": 1,
                "age_slot_rows": 4
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Nonroad.slot_isPopulated",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "coords": {
                "equipment_point_rows": 1,
                "age_slot_rows": 4
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "Nonroad.slot_grownModelYearFraction",
